# Project Vision

## Project Name

Life Goals

---

## Vision

Life Goals is a web application that helps people organize,
track and achieve their personal and professional goals.

Instead of focusing only on habits or only on tasks,
Life Goals combines:

- Goals
- Habits
- Milestones
- Financial objectives
- Personal reminders

into one application.

---

## Target Users

- Students
- Professionals
- Families
- Freelancers
- People interested in personal development

---

## Problem Statement

Most existing applications focus on one specific area.

For example:

- Habit tracking
- Task management
- Financial planning

Users often need multiple applications.

Life Goals combines these concepts into one simple platform.

---

## Success Criteria

The first version allows users to:

- Register
- Create goals
- Categorize goals
- Track progress
- Complete goals
- View a dashboard